<https://volcanoes.usgs.gov/volcanic_ash/density_hardness.html>
    dcterms:title "U.S. Geological Survey: 'Volcanic Ash – Impacts & Mitigation: Density & Hardness'" ;
    dcterms:creator "U.S. Geological Survey, Volcano Hazards Program" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.usgs.gov/information-policies-and-instructions/copyrights-and-credits (fetched 2026-10-04): \"USGS-authored or produced data and information are considered to be in the U.S. Public Domain.\" The same page warns that \"not all information, illustrations, or photographs on our site are\". The page's table credits its hardness values to Deer et al. (2004); the deck takes from it only the scale numbers of the Mohs reference minerals, which are facts, not the table or its other columns and rows."@en .

<https://pubs.usgs.gov/gip/gemstones/mineral.html>
    dcterms:title "U.S. Geological Survey: 'Natural Gemstones – Mineral Gemstones' (USGS General Interest Publication)" ;
    dcterms:creator "U.S. Geological Survey" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.usgs.gov/information-policies-and-instructions/copyrights-and-credits (fetched 2026-10-04): \"USGS-authored or produced data and information are considered to be in the U.S. Public Domain.\" The page is a USGS publication and carries no third-party credit for the passages used."@en .

<https://www.nps.gov/articles/mohs-hardness-scale.htm>
    dcterms:title "Mohs Hardness Scale (U.S. National Park Service article)" ;
    dcterms:creator "National Park Service, Geologic Resources Division (illustration by Heather Walborn, Guest Scientist)" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.nps.gov/aboutus/disclaimer.htm (fetched 2026-10-04): \"material created by the National Park Service and presented on this website, unless otherwise indicated, is generally considered in the public domain.\" The illustration whose alt text lists the scale is credited \"NPS illustration by Heather Walborn, Guest Scientist (2013-2014), NPS Geologic Resources Division\", so its status is uncertain; recorded as unknown and used for verification only."@en .

